WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.625
[Bram] An eldwyrm dug this.

00:00:06.166 --> 00:00:07.250
Asleep.

00:00:07.291 --> 00:00:08.791
How do you know?

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:10.041
We're not dead.

00:00:10.666 --> 00:00:11.666
Asleep, then.

00:00:12.875 --> 00:00:14.166
Lovely.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.166
Now is our chance. Now we kill the beast.

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:23.791
No. Now we pray he doesn't wake up.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:30.750
[ominous music]

00:00:31.916 --> 00:00:33.000
[whistle in distance]

00:00:34.916 --> 00:00:35.875
[swoosh]

00:00:37.375 --> 00:00:39.541
-[Sagan mewls]
-[Davion] What was that?

00:00:40.041 --> 00:00:41.291
Dinner.

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:44.166
[leaves rustling]

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:47.625
[crackling]

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:48.291
The only people I've ever seen shoot
that well have points on their ears.

00:00:48.291 --> 00:00:51.375
[sighs]
You're right. I should sleep on it.

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:55.250
I'll talk to Davion in the morning,
he'll understand, he'll listen.

00:00:55.375 --> 00:00:57.250
-[Marci snoring]
-[sighs]

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.750
Thank you, Marci.

00:01:05.125 --> 00:01:07.250
You always know exactly what to say.

00:01:07.375 --> 00:01:10.375
[tranquil music]

00:01:16.708 --> 00:01:20.083
[grunting and growling]

00:01:20.125 --> 00:01:22.000
[growling]

00:01:22.708 --> 00:01:23.833
[grunts]

00:01:29.958 --> 00:01:30.875
[snarls]

00:01:36.458 --> 00:01:39.458
[dreamy music]

00:01:48.833 --> 00:01:49.750
[Mirana] You?

00:01:49.833 --> 00:01:53.458
We have a better offer
than a few trinkets and empty promises.

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:57.625
May I introduce Mirana,
once Princess of the Moon,

00:01:57.708 --> 00:02:00.083
once Princess of the Sun, and now…

00:02:00.208 --> 00:02:02.208
princess of nothing at all.

00:02:04.333 --> 00:02:07.375
I locate precious things
for wealthy people.

00:02:07.458 --> 00:02:11.583
One of my clients happens to be
from the Helio Imperium.

00:02:12.208 --> 00:02:17.708
Your uncle.
And he wants you so very badly.

00:02:19.958 --> 00:02:20.708
I should have let
those villagers kill you.

00:02:20.708 --> 00:02:22.208
I should have let
those villagers kill you.

00:02:22.708 --> 00:02:23.958
Probably.

00:02:24.458 --> 00:02:25.833
The mute is yours.

00:02:25.875 --> 00:02:27.750
Take them downstairs.

00:02:28.875 --> 00:02:30.875
[ominous music]

00:02:31.333 --> 00:02:31.416
Do you love me?

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:34.333
You are the light
that shines behind my eyes.

00:02:34.416 --> 00:02:36.583
Mm, worship me.

00:02:36.666 --> 00:02:38.500
No one will worship you more.

00:02:39.041 --> 00:02:40.833
[breathes deeply]

00:02:40.916 --> 00:02:42.958
Do you love me?

00:02:43.625 --> 00:02:45.000
[gasps]

00:02:45.083 --> 00:02:47.958
Save me! Please, Goddess!

00:02:48.041 --> 00:02:50.791
Do you love me?

00:02:51.416 --> 00:02:53.166
Goddess, please!

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:55.291
[pants]
I love you!

00:02:55.375 --> 00:02:56.625
Please!

00:02:56.708 --> 00:02:58.333
[screams]

00:03:03.875 --> 00:03:06.875
[dreamy music]

00:03:10.791 --> 00:03:12.416
You fought well.

00:03:15.125 --> 00:03:17.250
You honor me.

00:03:19.416 --> 00:03:20.916
As you honor me.

00:03:21.666 --> 00:03:22.791
[grunts]

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:28.416
[gasps]

00:03:29.583 --> 00:03:30.875
[choking gasps]

00:03:37.833 --> 00:03:39.083
[tinkles]

00:03:40.833 --> 00:03:41.708
[gasps]

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:42.958
[Luna] We know what you want.

00:03:43.958 --> 00:03:46.958
The return of your Dark Lady, Mene.

00:03:48.125 --> 00:03:51.833
Mene, who would plunge the world
in endless shadow.

00:03:51.875 --> 00:03:53.375
-[gasps]
-[Luna] Not today.

00:03:54.333 --> 00:03:55.958
Give me the lotuses,

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:58.583
or I send all of you
back to her dead embrace.

00:03:58.625 --> 00:04:01.750
We… We don't have them. They're gone.

00:04:03.708 --> 00:04:06.250
-[grunts]
-[shrieks]

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:14.083
What… What have you done?
What have you done?

00:04:14.208 --> 00:04:19.250
-The lotuses. Now.
-Stop. Please. I don't have them.

00:04:20.083 --> 00:04:22.583
Lying. Unwise.

00:04:22.708 --> 00:04:24.125
[panting]

00:04:24.708 --> 00:04:26.000
[both grunts]

00:04:26.083 --> 00:04:26.125
[body thuds]

